<h3><u>Haye Zainab Ro Rahi Hai</u></h3>
                <div style=""width:100%"">
                                <p><p dir=""ltr"">haaye zainab ro rahi hai karbala khamosh hai<br />
jal gaye hai saare khaime, al-qama khamosh hai<br />
haaye zainab ro rahi hai....</p>

<p dir=""ltr"">chin gayi sar se hai chaadar, kya kare binte ali<br />
us taraf darya kanare ba-wafa khamosh hai<br />
haaye zainab ro rahi hai....</p>

<p dir=""ltr"">aagayi sham-e-ghareeba, ho gaye qaidi haram<br />
